WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:47.020 --> 00:01:49.380
Someone once said:

00:01:49.980 --> 00:01:53.290
There are poodles who are covered in grapes,

00:01:53.290 --> 00:01:56.120
of which you can find none sweeter...

00:01:56.120 --> 00:01:59.960
The Grapoodle!

00:02:01.160 --> 00:02:05.070
There are sea angels whose heads become

00:02:05.070 --> 00:02:08.170
the highest-quality sweet chestnuts...

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:11.970
Seachest Angelnuts!

00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:15.310
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:20.680
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:27.990
Toriko and Komatsu climbed the Sky Plant 
in order to capture the Ozone Grass.

00:02:27.990 --> 00:02:29.590
Toriko nearly faced his end

00:02:29.590 --> 00:02:34.390
inside the fearsome natural 
power of a cumulonimbus...

00:02:34.390 --> 00:02:37.560
I believe in you, Toriko-san...

00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:41.130
But Toriko came up with a 
new method for breathing

00:02:41.130 --> 00:02:43.970
that adapts to the harsh 
environment, beating the odds.

00:02:44.670 --> 00:02:49.210
After they made it safely out 
of the cumulonimbus cloud,

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:51.710
Toriko and Komatsu reached the Vegetable Sky

00:02:51.710 --> 00:02:53.850
and tasted a great variety of vegetables...

00:02:55.010 --> 00:02:59.550
That's when Komtasu spotted 
the Ozone Grass off a ledge.

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:04.360
At the same time, Toriko found what looks 
to be the footprint of a GT Robot...

00:03:06.630 --> 00:03:11.400
Confession in the Heavens! The 
Formation of the Invincible Duo!

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:20.740
This footprint...

00:03:22.210 --> 00:03:24.310
Toriko-san!

00:03:24.740 --> 00:03:28.280
I finally found it! Ozone Grass!

00:03:28.280 --> 00:03:29.650
What?! Seriously?!

00:03:29.650 --> 00:03:30.750
Over this way!

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:35.620
Huh?

00:03:40.630 --> 00:03:45.200
T-This is the King of 
Vegetables! Ozone Grass!

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:49.870
That's strange... The leaves 
were open just before.

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:52.900
It's a vegetable that's 
covered in layers of leaves.

00:03:52.900 --> 00:03:55.470
The same type as cabbage or hakusai!

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:15.690
W-What a shock!

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:19.060
I thought I'd gotten pesticide 
in my nose or something!

00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:21.100
Um, are you okay?

00:04:21.100 --> 00:04:22.870
Yeah, I'm fine!

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:27.770
This fearsome smell... And 
in such direct sunlight...

00:04:27.770 --> 00:04:33.410
I bet this thing absorbs all kinds of 
creatures that can't handle the stimulus.

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:38.880
That's how these leaves protect 
the Ozone Grass that's inside!

00:04:40.150 --> 00:04:43.090
Okay, let's get these leaves open!

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:44.620
Please do!

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:51.130
These things are hard! Tough...

00:04:51.530 --> 00:04:54.060
Reminds me of the BB Corn!

00:04:56.330 --> 00:04:59.870
I wonder... What's this sensation?

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:03.000
It's like... the ingredient 
is telling us no...

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:11.880
Don't peel down that leaf!

00:05:13.010 --> 00:05:14.180
Why?

00:05:26.690 --> 00:05:28.130
Huh?

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:30.430
A seed?

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:36.200
That's what it felt like when I 
was making the Century Soup...

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:40.740
All the different tastes... The combinations 
and dishes that just didn't work...

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:42.080
That's the feeling.

00:05:42.540 --> 00:05:44.380
Toriko-san!

00:05:44.380 --> 00:05:46.880
Catch me, please!

00:05:47.650 --> 00:05:49.680
Thank you.

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:52.250
Since when did you become such a daredevil?

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:55.190
It's because I believe in you, Toriko-san.

00:05:58.260 --> 00:06:01.330
It looks like it's reverted to a seed.

00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:07.500
Perhaps the Ozone Grass is a 
Special Preparation Ingredient.

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:08.770
What?!

00:06:08.770 --> 00:06:12.040
I think it's the same 
type as the Puffer Whale.

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:17.610
Delicate ingredients that react cautiously 
to prospective chefs and guests.

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:21.110
Those are Special Preparation Ingredients.

00:06:21.550 --> 00:06:26.490
I had a sense like the ingredient 
was telling you "not that leaf"

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:29.690
when you were pulling it earlier, Toriko-san.

00:06:30.220 --> 00:06:34.930
Perhaps there's an order in which 
you have to pull off the leaves.

00:06:34.930 --> 00:06:39.160
And if you get it wrong, then it looks 
like it turns back into a seed instantly.

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:45.100
Komatsu... You've already heard 
the voice of the ingredient?

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:49.040
I'm amazed your perception of the ingredients

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:51.740
has already been refined to this level...

00:06:51.740 --> 00:06:55.750
Is this the experience you gained 
from completing the Century Soup?

00:06:56.780 --> 00:07:02.850
Ozone Grass... I get it now. Not going 
to let us take a bite so easily, is it?

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:06.990
Let's look! There should be more around.

00:07:06.990 --> 00:07:09.860
Don't worry. I know we'll be able to eat it!

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:11.300
I can just tell!

00:07:11.300 --> 00:07:15.370
You can tell, can you? Did the 
ingredients tell you that, too?

00:07:19.170 --> 00:07:23.470
I felt it when I ate the 
vegetables in Vegetable Sky...

00:07:23.470 --> 00:07:27.010
I felt that the vegetables had chosen us.

00:07:27.010 --> 00:07:31.550
I could sense that the 
ingredients accepted us.

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:36.190
I'm sure that more Ozone Grass 
will pop up in front of us!

00:07:38.790 --> 00:07:40.920
Us, is it?

00:07:54.100 --> 00:07:56.670
See, here they are!

00:07:56.670 --> 00:07:58.510
Wow, look at 'em!

00:07:58.940 --> 00:08:00.480
With this many, I'm sure...

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:01.480
Yeah!

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:03.680
I won't make the same mistake twice!

00:08:03.680 --> 00:08:06.920
We're gonna unwrap the heart 
of the Ozone Grass, you betcha!

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:09.080
Yes, let's do it!

00:08:13.390 --> 00:08:14.320
So?

00:08:14.320 --> 00:08:15.620
I have no idea!

00:08:15.620 --> 00:08:17.830
You're tearing up!

00:08:18.860 --> 00:08:20.700
I'm getting frustrated!

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:23.360
Komtasu, try listening to 
the voice of the ingredient!

00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:24.270
Right!

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:27.100
I can't hear anything.

00:08:27.100 --> 00:08:28.470
Why not?!

00:08:28.470 --> 00:08:30.440
What were you talking about before, then?

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:33.070
For now, let's just try unwrapping one leaf.

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:34.210
Yeah...

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:54.700
It's no use... I can't 
catch the trick at all!

00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:56.760
It's not the color of the leaves...

00:08:56.760 --> 00:09:00.370
And not the number or pattern of 
veins in the leaves, either...

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:02.270
This is a problem.

00:09:02.270 --> 00:09:04.370
There's still plenty left,

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:07.210
but we can't go turning them 
all to seeds for no reason...

00:09:07.210 --> 00:09:09.280
Yes, you're right...

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:26.890
T-Toriko-san... Um...

00:09:27.860 --> 00:09:28.730
What is it?

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:34.830
Can you try pulling that leaf you've 
got at the same time as mine?

00:09:35.230 --> 00:09:36.240
This one?

00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:37.900
Here we go...

00:09:37.900 --> 00:09:39.300
Ready, set...

00:09:44.940 --> 00:09:46.680
It didn't turn into a seed!

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:48.310
I knew it!

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:50.680
I've figured it out! It's simultaneous!

00:09:50.680 --> 00:09:54.350
We have to pull down two leaves 
at exactly the same time!

00:09:54.350 --> 00:09:56.050
Two at the same time, is it?!

00:09:56.050 --> 00:09:59.620
I felt it when we were gripping 
two leaves just before.

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:04.030
Like the Ozone Grass was lowering 
its guard, just a little bit.

00:10:04.030 --> 00:10:05.800
Amazing, Komatsu!

00:10:05.800 --> 00:10:08.770
Then, you've finally heard 
the voice of the ingredient!

00:10:08.770 --> 00:10:09.970
Great going!

00:10:09.970 --> 00:10:12.340
Now that we know it, let's pull 
off these leaves right away!

00:10:12.340 --> 00:10:12.900
Right!

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:15.970
Ah, Toriko-san, not that leaf!

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:17.740
What? So we can't just choose randomly?

00:10:17.910 --> 00:10:20.280
Right. It seems that way.

00:10:30.790 --> 00:10:31.920
This one?

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:33.220
Yes, that leaf!

00:10:33.220 --> 00:10:34.490
That's the one, I think!

00:10:34.490 --> 00:10:36.590
I get it! It's the smell!

00:10:36.590 --> 00:10:39.300
We choose the two with the strongest smell!

00:10:39.300 --> 00:10:40.760
I see!

00:10:40.760 --> 00:10:43.130
Toriko-san, please handle the smelling!

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:44.630
Leave it to me!

00:10:44.630 --> 00:10:46.670
Komatsu, do the leaf right in front of you!

00:10:46.670 --> 00:10:47.470
Right!

00:10:47.770 --> 00:10:50.310
Here we go... Ready, set...

00:10:50.570 --> 00:10:51.470
What?!

00:10:54.280 --> 00:10:57.450
It's no use. We have to 
be exactly in sync, or...

00:10:57.450 --> 00:11:00.080
Damn... Maybe I was a little early...

00:11:17.130 --> 00:11:19.170
We've finally got one this far...

00:11:19.170 --> 00:11:20.270
Yes...

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:23.570
All that's left are the final two leaves.

00:11:23.570 --> 00:11:24.870
The time it took me

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:28.110
to differentiate the smell of 
the leaves of the Ozone Grass...

00:11:28.110 --> 00:11:31.750
I bet it would be at least Capture Level 60.

00:11:33.110 --> 00:11:34.120
Komatsu...

00:11:34.120 --> 00:11:35.180
Yes?

00:11:35.180 --> 00:11:38.690
What you said really saved me back there.

00:11:39.320 --> 00:11:40.220
Thank you.

00:11:40.220 --> 00:11:42.290
T-Toriko-san?

00:11:42.790 --> 00:11:47.860
If we get this Ozone Grass safely, 
I have a favor to ask of you.

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:50.260
A favor?

00:11:50.260 --> 00:11:51.000
Yeah...

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:10.450
You have a favor you want 
to ask <i>me</i>, Toriko-san?

00:12:11.380 --> 00:12:12.620
What is it?

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:14.290
Tell me now!

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:16.090
Come on, wait.

00:12:16.090 --> 00:12:18.090
After we make sure it's captured.

00:12:18.490 --> 00:12:21.130
We need to complete the 
old man's request first.

00:12:21.430 --> 00:12:22.560
Right.

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:28.170
Let's do it.

00:12:28.170 --> 00:12:29.400
Synchronize our breathing...

00:12:29.400 --> 00:12:30.300
Right!

00:12:30.300 --> 00:12:31.870
Ready, set...

00:12:40.250 --> 00:12:42.180
T-This is...

00:12:50.360 --> 00:12:54.190
It just moved a little, and 
look at this water spray!

00:12:54.190 --> 00:12:56.530
It's just gushing with vibrancy!

00:12:56.530 --> 00:12:57.930
Wow!

00:12:57.930 --> 00:13:00.170
What a fleshy leaf!

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:04.300
The center is so stuffed, it looks 
like it could burst any moment!

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:09.070
Looking closely, the veins 
are shining and pulsating!

00:13:09.070 --> 00:13:12.810
Cocking my ear, I can hear 
the leaf vibrating...

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:17.820
I've never seen a vegetable 
this full of life!

00:13:17.820 --> 00:13:22.050
All the tons of sunlight shining down...

00:13:22.050 --> 00:13:25.960
All the minerals from the 
volcanic ash clouds...

00:13:26.220 --> 00:13:29.360
This leaf has absorbed them all!

00:13:31.730 --> 00:13:34.030
Toriko-san... You're drooling. Drooling!

00:13:34.630 --> 00:13:39.500
It smells so fresh and delicious, 
it's abnormally whetting my appetite.

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:45.640
No, it's not just my appetite... It's 
like my entire body is craving it!

00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:46.980
Is this...

00:13:47.640 --> 00:13:49.780
Could this ingredient be...

00:13:50.380 --> 00:13:52.280
Let's try it!

00:13:52.550 --> 00:13:54.180
But, this is for the President...

00:13:54.180 --> 00:13:56.150
We know how to extract it now!

00:13:56.150 --> 00:13:59.360
We'll just capture another 
one to give to the old man.

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:01.420
You're completely contradicting yourself...

00:14:01.420 --> 00:14:03.960
We've gotta taste it first!

00:14:03.960 --> 00:14:05.160
Right!

00:14:05.160 --> 00:14:09.100
We were able to capture this 
because of you, Komatsu.

00:14:09.100 --> 00:14:10.170
You try it first!

00:14:10.400 --> 00:14:15.470
Oh, but if it weren't for you, I couldn't 
have made it here above the clouds...

00:14:15.470 --> 00:14:17.570
So you should go first, Toriko-san.

00:14:17.570 --> 00:14:19.180
Oh? Then don't mind if I do!

00:14:19.180 --> 00:14:20.610
He's not holding back one bit...

00:14:20.610 --> 00:14:22.340
Then here I go...

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:23.950
I give thanks...

00:14:26.280 --> 00:14:28.280
W-W-What's that?!

00:14:30.650 --> 00:14:31.990
Toriko-san?

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:34.120
It's ruined!

00:14:34.490 --> 00:14:38.230
Sorry, but I couldn't eat it at all!

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:40.800
Looks like something went wrong...

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:44.070
Wait, could it be...

00:14:45.300 --> 00:14:48.940
We have to bite into it together, too?

00:14:48.940 --> 00:14:49.970
Let's try again!

00:14:49.970 --> 00:14:51.270
Right!

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:55.780
Sheesh!

00:14:55.780 --> 00:14:58.550
We even have to eat it at the same time?

00:14:58.550 --> 00:15:01.580
This ingredient sure loves twosomes!

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:03.320
Anyway, we're eating it together!

00:15:03.320 --> 00:15:04.520
Get in sync!

00:15:04.520 --> 00:15:05.520
Right...

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:09.390
We give thanks for all this 
world's great bounty...

00:15:09.390 --> 00:15:11.330
Let's eat!

00:15:16.860 --> 00:15:18.430
Ready, set...

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:24.070
We did it!

00:15:24.070 --> 00:15:26.170
We managed to eat it!

00:15:26.170 --> 00:15:28.280
Thank goodness...

00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:33.080
And whoa... whoa... it's really delicious!

00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:35.820
A soft, but strong texture...

00:15:35.820 --> 00:15:38.450
A delightful chewiness 
where if you lightly chew,

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:40.350
your teeth just bounce right off!

00:15:40.350 --> 00:15:42.460
The sinewy fibers!

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:45.930
All the sounds carried through the jaw!

00:15:45.930 --> 00:15:47.930
Just chewing it is fun!

00:15:47.930 --> 00:15:50.360
Apple, grapefruit, kiwi...

00:15:50.360 --> 00:15:55.330
The fresh sweetness and tartness of 
fruits are racing inside my mouth!

00:15:55.330 --> 00:16:00.670
And chasing behind it, the deep 
richness of sweet potato and pumpkin!

00:16:00.670 --> 00:16:03.840
It's far beyond a mere vegetable!

00:16:03.840 --> 00:16:06.210
Incredibly delicious!

00:16:15.850 --> 00:16:17.060
Toriko-san?

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:20.190
This feeling...

00:16:20.190 --> 00:16:22.030
There can be no doubt!

00:16:22.690 --> 00:16:28.130
This ingredient is exactly 
what my Gourmet Cells wanted!

00:16:28.900 --> 00:16:32.470
It was an ingredient that raised 
the level of my Gourmet Cells!

00:16:35.570 --> 00:16:39.940
Old man... You knew this 
all along, didn't you?

00:16:39.940 --> 00:16:43.450
You knew the Ozone Grass 
would agree with my cells.

00:16:43.450 --> 00:16:49.350
And that I couldn't capture it or 
eat it unless I worked as a team...

00:16:49.350 --> 00:16:52.590
Join together with a chef 
who can prepare ingredients

00:16:52.590 --> 00:16:56.190
at the same level as yourself, 
and always travel together.

00:16:57.630 --> 00:17:02.070
I know... I understand, old man.

00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:06.300
Hey, Komatsu...

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:07.170
Yes?

00:17:07.640 --> 00:17:08.440
You...

00:17:09.610 --> 00:17:15.380
You... ever thought of teaming up with me?

00:17:21.550 --> 00:17:27.190
Well, you know... If you're up for it...

00:17:27.620 --> 00:17:33.700
Let's team up, and make the 
ultimate Full Course, together.

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:37.870
M-Me, and you?

00:17:38.130 --> 00:17:40.270
Yeah. How about it?

00:17:40.270 --> 00:17:46.140
I-I... Ever since I met you...

00:17:46.410 --> 00:17:51.280
I've wanted to cook your 
ingredients, Toriko-san...

00:17:51.850 --> 00:17:57.420
Eating something is the 
same as receiving its life.

00:17:57.420 --> 00:18:00.820
You taught me that, Toriko-san,

00:18:00.820 --> 00:18:03.260
and I've always wanted to take 
the ingredients you showed me

00:18:03.260 --> 00:18:05.730
and make them even more 
delicious and wonderful!

00:18:07.430 --> 00:18:12.800
Maybe it was presumptuous of me, but 
I've always wanted to be your partner!

00:18:12.800 --> 00:18:16.000
Really? It never crossed my mind back then.

00:18:16.940 --> 00:18:19.510
But it's how I feel now.

00:18:19.810 --> 00:18:23.580
Komatsu, you have something I lack.

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:26.910
A passion for being the best cook there is...

00:18:28.050 --> 00:18:31.350
And a gift of being loved by the ingredients.

00:18:32.690 --> 00:18:36.790
Will you be my partner?

00:18:41.560 --> 00:18:42.460
Yes!

00:18:42.900 --> 00:18:45.130
I hope I can be of service!

00:18:47.400 --> 00:18:49.700
Partnering with Toriko-san...

00:18:50.070 --> 00:18:53.170
I can't believe this day has 
come. It's like a dream!

00:18:53.670 --> 00:18:57.380
It really does feel like 
I've climbed to heaven!

00:19:02.150 --> 00:19:04.920
Toriko-san, look at that Ozone Grass leaf!

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:07.720
It looks like a heart from this angle.

00:19:07.720 --> 00:19:10.560
So what? Don't be creeping me out.

00:19:11.090 --> 00:19:14.830
Well, the Ozone Grass was 
definitely delicious.

00:19:14.830 --> 00:19:17.660
But I'm not putting it into my Full Course.

00:19:17.660 --> 00:19:18.660
I'm going to hold the spot.

00:19:18.660 --> 00:19:21.200
Huh? You're not?

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:22.900
You should put it in the course!

00:19:22.900 --> 00:19:26.340
It's the ingredient that marks the 
formation of our team, after all!

00:19:26.340 --> 00:19:27.570
Nope!

00:19:27.570 --> 00:19:33.850
It's true that it evolved my cells, 
but this ingredient favors you.

00:19:34.880 --> 00:19:37.080
I noticed it while we were capturing it.

00:19:37.550 --> 00:19:41.490
The Ozone Grass came to you.

00:19:41.490 --> 00:19:43.150
I see.

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:48.930
So that's why the leaves were open when 
I first saw the Ozone Grass alone.

00:19:49.390 --> 00:19:52.960
Plus, it'll be a pain to have an ingredient

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:55.330
that two people have to eat 
on the Full Course, you know?

00:19:55.330 --> 00:19:56.100
True.

00:19:57.070 --> 00:20:00.700
And besides, with the two of us as a team,

00:20:00.700 --> 00:20:05.780
I'm sure we'll encounter some even better 
ingredient out there in the world.

00:20:05.780 --> 00:20:07.850
Yes! Exactly!

00:20:08.180 --> 00:20:11.080
I'll just cook.

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:15.920
All so that the ingredients you choose 
will be even more delicious, Toriko-san!

00:20:15.920 --> 00:20:17.620
Well put, Komatsu!

00:20:36.570 --> 00:20:38.510
A GT Robot...

00:20:40.440 --> 00:20:41.740
No...

00:20:45.480 --> 00:20:47.080
Sabrina

00:20:48.150 --> 00:20:50.320
Pa-pa-pa-para

00:20:50.690 --> 00:20:52.150
Sabrina

00:20:54.090 --> 00:21:01.260
Rainy day, danced down on the night city

00:21:01.260 --> 00:21:08.140
You had deep red lipstick on you

00:21:08.140 --> 00:21:11.910
Like you were toyed with

00:21:11.910 --> 00:21:15.340
Like you were tasted

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:22.450
A solitary silhouette seen through the glass

00:21:22.450 --> 00:21:29.190
One day, one day... Search for true love

00:21:29.190 --> 00:21:36.260
Even if hurt by the lies going around town

00:21:36.260 --> 00:21:41.000
Rottening fruit

00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:42.570
Sabrina

00:21:46.610 --> 00:21:48.640
Gourmet News!

00:21:49.610 --> 00:21:51.210
I'm your host, Tina!

00:21:51.210 --> 00:21:56.150
I'd like to introduce to everyone 
the taste of the Ozone Grass, but...

00:21:56.450 --> 00:21:59.820
I've run out of ingredients 
to mix together...

00:22:00.550 --> 00:22:02.360
Whatever shall I do...?

00:22:02.360 --> 00:22:05.120
In a pickle, Signora?

00:22:05.630 --> 00:22:07.760
That voice, could it be?!

00:22:07.760 --> 00:22:09.160
Buon giorno!

00:22:09.160 --> 00:22:12.430
The owner-chef of a famous Italian 
restaurant in the Gourmet Tower,

00:22:12.430 --> 00:22:14.800
and the Fantasista of the Kitchen,

00:22:14.800 --> 00:22:16.770
saving countless housewives 
and career women...

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:18.700
Taccino Kawagoe!

00:22:18.700 --> 00:22:19.440
Si!

00:22:19.440 --> 00:22:23.210
Today I'll be the one introducing 
a fantastic and quick recipe

00:22:23.210 --> 00:22:25.950
to easily recreate the 
flavor of the Ozone Grass!

00:22:25.950 --> 00:22:26.880
You will?

00:22:26.880 --> 00:22:28.480
Thank you very much!

00:22:29.950 --> 00:22:34.490
First, peel a carrot into thin 
slices, and salt lightly.

00:22:34.490 --> 00:22:36.890
Prepare orange juice and pulp...

00:22:36.890 --> 00:22:38.660
Add it to the carrots...

00:22:38.660 --> 00:22:41.490
And then, add olive oil!

00:22:43.330 --> 00:22:47.030
Taccino Fantasy!

00:22:46.930 --> 00:22:49.800
Carrot and Orange Salad

00:22:53.740 --> 00:22:55.640
A heaping helping of buono!

00:22:55.640 --> 00:22:59.380
Next time, I'll come to help 
in your own kitchen, Signora!

00:23:00.010 --> 00:23:01.250
Ciao!

00:23:01.950 --> 00:23:04.520
O-On to the next story!

00:23:07.050 --> 00:23:10.810
What in the world have they run into? This aura of incredible danger...!

00:23:10.810 --> 00:23:13.890
The warning blares throughout the vegetable garden in the sky!

00:23:14.360 --> 00:23:17.230
Shocking Encounter! A Mysterious Life Form Appears!

00:23:17.580 --> 00:23:19.440
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
